code-quality","hacktoberfest","linter","pep8","static-analysis","static-code-analysis"],"visibility":"public","forks":1204,"open_issues":1060,"watchers":5620,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Pylint 1.9.4 on Python 3.7 still stumbles across the use of a `StopIteration` exception.\r\n\r\nThis has been reported already earlier in issue #2241 and #2579, which were both closed without solving the issue.\r\n\r\nWe would like to use pylint on both py2.7 and py3.4+, preferrably the same version.\r\n\r\nAccording to the metadata of pylint 1.9.4 on pypi, Python 3.7 is supported (requires: `Python >=2.7, !=3.0.*, !=3.1.*, !=3.2.*, !=3.3.*`)\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\n1. create `hello.py` with code `print('hello')`\r\n2. run `python -m pylint hello.py`\r\n\r\n### Current behavior\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ python -m pylint hello.py\r\nNo config file found, using default configuration\r\n************* Module hello\r\nC:  3, 0: Trailing newlines (trailing-newlines)\r\nTraceback (most recent call last):\r\n  File \"/Users/maiera/virtualenvs/pywbem37/lib/python3.7/site-packages/astroid/decorators.py\", line 89, in wrapped\r\n    res = next(generator)\r\nStopIteration\r\n\r\nDuring handling of the above exception, another exception occurred:\r\n\r\nTraceback (most recent call last):\r\n  File \"/Users/maiera/virtualenvs/pywbem37/lib/python3.7/site-packages/astroid/decorators.py\", line 104, in wrapped\r\n    raise StopIteration\r\nStopIteration\r\n\r\nThe above exception was the direct cause of the following exception:\r\n\r\nTraceback (most recent call last):\r\n  File \"/usr/local/Cellar/python/3.7.2_2/Frameworks/Python.framework/Versions/3.7/lib/python3.7/runpy.py\", line 193, in _run_module_as_main\r\n    \"__main__\", mod_spec)\r\n  File \"/usr/local/Cellar/python/3.7.2_2/Frameworks/Python.framework/Versions/3.7/lib/python3.7/runpy.py\", line 85, in _run_code\r\n    exec(code, run_globals)\r\n  File \"/Users/maiera/virtualenvs/pywbem37/lib/python3.7/site-packages/pylint/__main__.py\", line 7, in <module>\r\n    pylint.run_pylint()\r\n  File \"/Users/maiera/virtualenvs/pywbem37/lib/python3.7/site-packages/pylint/__init__.py\", line 16, in run_pylint\r\n    Run(sys.argv[1:])\r\n  File \"/Users/maiera/virtualenvs/pywbem37/lib/python3.7/site-packages/pylint/lint.py\", line 1353, in __init__\r\n    linter.check(args)\r\n  File \"/Users/maiera/virtualenvs/pywbem37/lib/python3.7/site-packages/pylint/lint.py\", line 774, in check\r\n    self._do_check(files_or_modules)\r\n  File \"/Users/maiera/virtualenvs/pywbem37/lib/python3.7/site-packages/pylint/lint.py\", line 907, in _do_check\r\n    self.check_astroid_module(ast_node, walker, rawcheckers, tokencheckers)\r\n  File \"/Users/maiera/virtualenvs/pywbem37/lib/python3.7/site-packages/pylint/lint.py\", line 986, in check_astroid_module\r\n    walker.walk(ast_node)\r\n  File \"/Users/maiera/virtualenvs/pywbem37/lib/python3.7/site-packages/pylint/utils.py\", line 1011, in walk\r\n    cb(astroid)\r\n  File \"/Users/maiera/virtualenvs/pywbem37/lib/python3.7/site-packages/pylint/checkers/base.py\", line 1571, in visit_module\r\n    self._check_docstring('module', node)\r\n  File \"/Users/maiera/virtualenvs/pywbem37/lib/python3.7/site-packages/pylint/checkers/base.py\", line 1633, in _check_docstring\r\n    func = utils.safe_infer(node.body[0].value.func)\r\n  File \"/Users/maiera/virtualenvs/pywbem37/lib/python3.7/site-packages/pylint/checkers/utils.py\", line 825, in safe_infer\r\n    next(inferit)\r\nRuntimeError: generator raised StopIteration\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Expected behavior\r\n\r\nShould produce output without failing.\r\n\r\n### pylint --version output\r\n```\r\n$ pylint --version\r\nNo config file found, using default configuration\r\npylint 1.9.4, \r\nastroid 1.6.5\r\nPython 3.7.2 (default, Feb 12 2019, 08:16:38) \r\n[Clang 10.0.0 (clang-1000.11.45.5)]\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Further environment data\r\n* MacOS\r\n* Python is used in a virtualenv","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/2762/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/2762/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]